 {"i":"1opxukf","o":"<div class=\"cs-li cs-bul\" style=\"margin-left:0px\">","h":"<span class=\"cs-blue\"><span class=\"cs-u\">§156</span></span> <span class=\"cs-def\"><strong>'징계처분'</strong></span> = <span class=\"cs-u\">공법상 감독관계에서 질서유지 위해 과하는 신분적 제재</span><span class=\"cs-exam\">【변23·21】【변기22】</span>","k":"1mhspy0"},
